  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Implement `gosop inline-detach` (https://github.com/ProtonMail/gosop/pull/40)\r\n* Handle multiple keys in a KEYS or CERTS object (https://github.com/ProtonMail/gosop/pull/41)\r\n* Support `--verifications-out=@FD:...`\r\n* Improve profile handling (https://github.com/ProtonMail/gosop/pull/37)\r\n* Improve data type detection in `gosop armor`\r\n* Publish binaries on release (https://github.com/ProtonMail/gosop/pull/36)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ProtonMail/gosop/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0"
